        "BODY": "Levi Rietveld, the creator of Crypto Crusaders, has reiterated his stance on buying XRP during price downturns, a strategy he says has been consistent across his platforms. In a recent video posted on X, Rietveld highlighted his earlier calls to purchase XRP at significantly lower prices and urged his audience to act decisively when sentiment in the market appeared weakest. “I told you guys to buy XRP at $2.67. I told you again to buy XRP at $2.72. Now look at where the price is today,” Rietveld said. The video, released when XRP was trading at $2.77, has since gained attention as the cryptocurrency moved higher to $2.81, recording a 24-hour peak of $2.82. MAJOR #XRP PUMP! pic.twitter.com/JCoMK2n2sf — Levi | Crypto Crusaders (@LeviRietveld) September 27, 2025 Surviving Market Manipulation In his video, Rietveld criticized what he described as institutional efforts to shake out retail traders , suggesting that recent volatility was not purely market-driven. He urged his followers to see these periods of heavy selling as opportunities to increase their holdings rather than as reasons to sell, telling them to “buy more than you’ve ever bought before.” Rietveld argued that retail traders often panic when prices drop, which, in his view, allows larger players to profit at their expense. He advised investors to act decisively during such downturns, insisting that discipline and confidence during volatility and market manipulation could help them avoid losses and position themselves for gains when prices recover. Encouraging Traders to Remain Alert Beyond the price discussion, Rietveld urged his audience to stay disciplined and avoid reacting emotionally to market swings. He cautioned traders against falling for what he described as common market traps and advised them to remain consistent in their strategy rather than panicking during sudden price dips . We are on X, follow us to connect with us :- @TimesTabloid1 — TimesTabloid (@TimesTabloid1) June 15, 2025 His tone throughout the video suggested frustration with retail traders who he believes panic in response to short-term price trends. By encouraging a disciplined strategy, Rietveld reinforced his earlier claims that staying committed during volatile periods could lead to stronger long-term results . XRP’s Price Shift While XRP struggled over the past week, its price is now recovering rapidly. The immediate price movement following Rietveld’s video has been modest but notable, with XRP rising from $2.77 to $2.81 within the same day, briefly touching $2.82. Rietveld’s post suggests an XRP Mega pump is coming, and this increase appears to serve as partial validation of his advice to buy during periods of fear. Disclaimer : This content is meant to inform and should not be considered financial advice. The views expressed in this article may include the author’s personal opinions and do not represent Times Tabloid’s opinion. Readers are advised to conduct thorough research before making any investment decisions. Any action taken by the reader is strictly at their own risk. Times Tabloid is not responsible for any financial losses. Follow us on X , Facebook , Telegram , and Google News The post Expert Predicts XRP Mega Pump. Here’s How to Profit from It appeared first on Times Tabloid .",
