        "ID": 52389425,
        "URL": "https://bitcoinworld.co.in/cardano-price-prediction-which-is-the-best-crypto-to-buy-now-analysts-highlight-digitaps-50x-presale/",
        "BODY": "BitcoinWorld Cardano Price Prediction: Which Is The Best Crypto To Buy Now? Analysts Highlight Digitap’s 50x Presale Cardano is hanging by a thread at $0.81. The OG altcoin slipped over 7% this week after whales dumped 160 million ADA and dormant wallets roared back to life. Analysts say $0.84 is the make-or-break zone. Hold it, and bulls could push for $0.96. Lose it, and a quick slide to $0.76 is on the cards. That’s a tricky scenario for smart investors who are looking for the best crypto to buy now. And it might explain why most wallets are moving hundreds of thousands of dollars to the Digitap ($TAP) presale . It’s the world’s first omni-bank and has already raised nearly $200K in its presale. While Cardano lingers in uncertainty, analysts hint at a potential 50x price move in 2025 for $TAP. Cardano Balances Between Key Support and Stubborn Caps Cardano is dancing on a knife’s edge. After slipping to $0.81 , ADA now finds itself locked between heavy support and stubborn resistance zones. The major support sits between $0.79 and $0.84. This level has been tested multiple times. If ADA can stay above this floor, there’s room for buyers to push toward $0.92 and possibly $0.96, both of which have acted as ceilings in the past. Climbing past $0.96 could shift sentiment and open the door to the much-awaited $1 milestone. At that point, ADA might land on the investor radar for Q4. Source: TradingView But every coin has two sides. A break below $0.79 could be in the cards. And such a scenario could expose ADA to deeper support around $0.76 and even $0.72. That would shift sentiment and put bulls on the defensive. For now, the trend somehow still leans bullish. The moving averages favor buyers, and RSI sits close to 50. In plain terms, Cardano’s Q4 2025 journey could go anywhere from here. Hold the floor, and the upside targets stay alive. Lose it, and the bears take the driver’s seat. In any case, Cardano is far from being considered the best crypto to