        "BODY": "As 2026 approaches, speculation surrounding XRP’s potential has intensified, with bold forecasts emerging. Among the latest comes from a long-time Bitcoin investor known as Pumpius, who has been active in the industry since 2013. The veteran crypto trader suggested that XRP could climb to $25 before the end of 2025, a target that would place the asset in the same trillion-dollar league as Bitcoin. The comment was made during a community discussion initiated by X user Chain Cartel, who asked his followers to share their predictions for XRP’s price as the year draws to an end. Pumpius’s projection would require more than nine times the gains from current levels and stands out as one of the most ambitious forecasts circulating within the community in recent weeks. #XRP to $25 before 2026 https://t.co/7GMFJ9psR9 — Pumpius (@pumpius) September 24, 2025 Other prominent voices in the market have put forward similar targets. Analyst Alex Cobb previously indicated that XRP might reach $22 by December , while more cautious commentators have suggested that $10 is a more realistic ceiling. Many of these optimistic views were made earlier in the year when XRP was closer to its highs in January and July. Since then, weaker price action has tempered much of the bullish momentum, though strong expectations remain among certain sections of the community. We are on X, follow us to connect with us :- @TimesTabloid1 — TimesTabloid (@TimesTabloid1) June 15, 2025 XRP’s Path Presently, XRP is priced at $2.77, representing a decline of over 8% during the past week. The token has been under pressure since July, and many traders are watching October closely for signs of recovery. A key factor shaping sentiment is the prospect of regulatory approval for XRP ETFs, which some industry leaders argue could attract billions of dollars in inflows. Canary Capital’s CEO has supported this view , noting that such developments could lend weight to predictions of double-digit valuations in the near term. Despite this, the broader market remains cautious. The Fear & Greed Index is currently at 32, showing prevailing bearish conditions. As the countdown to 2026 continues, the XRP community remains divided between ambitious long-term projections and near-term caution. Pumpius’s forecast of $25 sets a bold benchmark. While market conditions remain uncertain, it reflects the strong belief among some investors that XRP still has the potential to achieve historic gains. Disclaimer : This content is meant to inform and should not be considered financial advice. The views expressed in this article may include the author’s personal opinions and do not represent Times Tabloid’s opinion. Readers are advised to conduct thorough research before making any investment decisions. Any action taken by the reader is strictly at their own risk. Times Tabloid is not responsible for any financial losses. Follow us on X , Facebook , Telegram , and Google News The post Legendary Bitcoin Investor Predicts XRP Rally to $25. Here’s the Timeline appeared first on Times Tabloid .",
